{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e18-scene-07",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "誓死守住这座空城  (Vowing to Guard the Empty Fort)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Realizing why Xingtian kept Chun Yuqiao's resignation secret, Bu Xiaogu confronts the chairwoman directly and pledges to hold the production department together. Listen to Xiaogu in Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "董事长，您为什么要摆空城计？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "您一面让淳于总离职，承担魅力远航的罪责。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "一面又让他配合保守秘密，好继续维持星天稳定的局面。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "这是您的意思吧？我没有猜错吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我以为只有宫斗剧里面才有秘不发丧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "没想到您这个让我真心佩服的女企业家，竟然会做出这样的事情。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "星天如今的制作部门，是淳于总一手打造的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "时至今日我仍敢说，这是最有战力的团队。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "当下公司摆空城计，足以证明让淳于总离职就是个错误。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我知道淳于总对这一行的热爱，也知道他付出了多少。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "所以不管这是一座怎样的空城，我都会努力守住。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "等到了一切被证明的时候，希望您能纠正错误，让淳于总回来。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "董事长，您为什么要摆空城计？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Chairwoman, why are you staging an empty fort strategy?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "您一面让淳于总离职，承担魅力远航的罪责。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'On one hand, you let Mr Chun Yuqiao resign and bear the blame for the travel show.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "一面又让他配合保守秘密，好继续维持星天稳定的局面。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'On the other hand, you had him keep it secret to preserve stability at Xingtian.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "这是您的意思吧？我没有猜错吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'That was your intention, right? I have not guessed wrong, have I?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我以为只有宫斗剧里面才有秘不发丧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I thought keeping a leader's departure secret only happened in palace dramas.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "没想到您这个让我真心佩服的女企业家，竟然会做出这样的事情。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I never expected a businesswoman I genuinely admire like you to do something like this.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "星天如今的制作部门，是淳于总一手打造的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Xingtian's production department today was built single-handedly by Mr Chun Yuqiao.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "时至今日我仍敢说，这是最有战力的团队。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Even today I still dare say this is the most capable fighting team.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "当下公司摆空城计，足以证明让淳于总离职就是个错误。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Staging this empty fort right now proves that letting Mr Chun Yuqiao resign was a mistake.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我知道淳于总对这一行的热爱，也知道他付出了多少。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I know Mr Chun Yuqiao's passion for this industry and how much he has sacrificed for it.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "所以不管这是一座怎样的空城，我都会努力守住。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'So no matter what kind of empty fort this is, I will work hard to guard it.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "等到了一切被证明的时候，希望您能纠正错误，让淳于总回来。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'When everything has been proven, I hope you will correct this mistake and bring Mr Chun Yuqiao back.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "董事长，您为什么要摆空城计？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "您一面让淳于总离职，承担魅力远航的罪责。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "一面又让他配合保守秘密，好继续维持星天稳定的局面。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "这是您的意思吧？我没有猜错吧？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我以为只有宫斗剧里面才有秘不发丧。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "没想到您这个让我真心佩服的女企业家，竟然会做出这样的事情。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "星天如今的制作部门，是淳于总一手打造的。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "时至今日我仍敢说，这是最有战力的团队。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "当下公司摆空城计，足以证明让淳于总离职就是个错误。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我知道淳于总对这一行的热爱，也知道他付出了多少。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "所以不管这是一座怎样的空城，我都会努力守住。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "等到了一切被证明的时候，希望您能纠正错误，让淳于总回来。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Refusing to abandon the team Chun Yuqiao built from scratch, Xiaogu vows to guard Xingtian's empty fort until she proves he belongs back at the helm. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "明天见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
